                                        <img src="https://tuxcare.com/wp-content/themes/tuxcare-2022/img/icon.png" alt=""> <p class="case-study-title">Case Study</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <h4>Proofpoint</h4>
                                    <div class="content">
                                        <p>“TuxCare services allow for faster, more consistent,
                                            and easier updates. Any customer of KernelCare will see value almost
                                            immediately.”</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <a href="/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Proofpoint-Case-Study.pdf" class="case-link"><i class='fas fa-arrow-right'></i></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="col-lg-4">
                                <div class="case-study__item middle">
                                    <div class="thumb text-center">
                                        <img src="https://tuxcare.com/wp-content/themes/tuxcare-2022/img/temp/src.png" alt="">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="case-icon">
                                        <img src="https://tuxcare.com/wp-content/themes/tuxcare-2022/img/icon.png" alt=""> <p class="case-study-title">Case Study</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <h4>SRC</h4>
                                    <div class="content"><p>“I really like this setup with AlmaLinux and TuxCare,
                                        where we can put support on our critical infrastructure, but don’t
                                            need to add support where we don’t need it.”
                                    </p></div>
                                    <a href="/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/SRC-Case-Study.pdf" class="case-link"><i class='fas fa-arrow-right'></i></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4">
                                <div class="case-study__item right">
                                    <div class="thumb text-center">
                                        <img src="https://tuxcare.com/wp-content/themes/tuxcare-2022/img/temp/appsignal.png" alt="">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="case-icon">
                                        <img src="https://tuxcare.com/wp-content/themes/tuxcare-2022/img/icon.png" alt=""> <p class="case-study-title">Case Study</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <h4>AppSignal</h4>
                                    <div class="content"><p>“With fewer reboots, we save on costs, but I would
                                            look at it more like saving focus. We’ve got more time now
                                            to work on interesting stuff instead of having to babysit a
                                                reboot.”
                                    </p></div>
                                    <a href="/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/TUXCARE_CASESTUDY_APPSIGNAL_V3c.pdf" class="case-link"><i class='fas fa-arrow-right'></i></a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Case study end -->

